        "doc": "**The two readings of \"dense subset\" define the same cardinal function at every infinite\ncardinal.** Every bracketing witness is turned into a strict witness of at least its size by\n`mk_le_ded'_of_isDenseIn`, at the cost of a countable factor in the dense subset, which an\ninfinite `κ` absorbs.",
        "hypotheses": [
          {
            "name": "hκ",
